Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Phase 4 engine patches 0011-0015: prompt reading and
 multi-stream decode

- 0011 row reduce-scatter for prompt partials at three ranks or more (same bits)
- 0012 prompt projections by pfdense, prompt chunks of 1,024 rows
- 0013 prompt layer tails in two halves, each half's exchange overlapped with the other's compute (same bits)
- 0014 shared rounds of 64 rows, one drafter pass a round (timed and priced), batched absorbs
- 0015 shared rounds price the drafter's pass by the streams that draft
ZIG_TREE moves to the patched tree de18a25b.

